    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market is this impressive four-bedroom property extending to approximately 174 sq.m (1,873 sq.ft) ideally located in the centre of Kiltimagh Town. Offering exceptional space and versatility, this unique property presents a fantastic opportunity for those seeking a home with business potential or an investment with scope for further development.\r\n\r\nOccupying a prominent town-centre position, the property formerly operated as a public house and retains a spacious and adaptable ground floor layout. the ground floor two large open-plan rooms together with a third room to the rear, which provides access to a private yard with the added benefit of valuable off-street parking. The ground floor lends itself to a variety of potential uses, including retail, office, hospitality or conversion to additional residential accommodation, subject to necessary planning permission.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the first floor offers bright and generously proportioned living accommodation. A spacious open-plan Kitchen and Dining area forms the heart of the home and enjoys beautiful views of the surrounding rolling countryside at the rear. There are four well apportioned Bedrooms together with a family Bathroom, providing ample space for growing families or those requiring additional accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe property's central location ensures every local amenity is within walking distance, including Shops, Schools and community facilities, while its flexible layout offers endless possibilities for owner-occupiers, investors or entrepreneurs looking to combine home and business under one roof.\r\n\r\nProperties offering location, level of space and commercial potential rarely come to the market. Whether you're looking for a substantial family home, a mixed-use investment or a property with exciting redevelopment possibilities, this is an opportunity not to be missed. Early viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, contact the sole selling agent John Higgins Auctioneer on 094 9631372."
      },
      {
